    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p> Whatever you held in that hand is punched right out of your grip. When you look down at your hand one of your fingers is dangling by a small scrap of tissue.</p> <p><strong>Effects:</strong> Whatever you held in that hand goes flying 1d10/3 yards in a random direction. If the object was fragile it breaks rather than flies. You also lose one finger – Amputation (Easy).</p>"
